# Media Rules

## Video

- Private originals/renditions
- Transcode async via queue
- Playback only after Access Engine allow
- Short-lived signed URLs only
- Support multi-quality HLS/DASH

## Documents

- Versioned blobs
- Authz before preview/download
- MIME allowlist + size limits

## Never

- Public ACL on paid objects
- Eternal signed URLs
- Skipping entitlement checks for “convenience”
